        "b": 600.1224272000001
      },
      "content": "Forced  Cooling:  When  receiving  indoor  forced  cooling  signal,  cooling  operation  will  start  in  a frequency signaled by indoor unit. Only air discharge temperature and over current protection features are effective and other protection features are invalid."
    },
    {
