        "t": 593.817349,
        "r": 550.7031411600002,
        "b": 553.4488610000001
      },
      "content": "Rated,  Middle  and  Minimum  Capacity  Operation:  When  receiving  indoor,  rated,  middle  and minimum capacity operation signal, outdoor unit will operate as per wind speed and frequency set by EEPROM and all the protection features are effective."
    },
